🔥 Q20 — Final Interview Challenge
You need a salary report for management.
Consider only employees who:
are older than 25
earn 50,000 or more
For each city, calculate:
Number of employees
Average salary
Highest salary
Lowest salary
Then show only the 2 cities with the highest average salary.

Solutions:
db.employees.aggregate([{$unwind:"$skills"}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$unwind:"$skills"},{$group:{_id:"$skills",employeeCount:{$sum:1}}},{$sort:{employeeCount:-1}},{$project:{_id:0,skills:"$_id",employeeCount:1}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$lookup:{from:"departments",localField:"departmentId",foreignField:"_id",as:"department_information"}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$lookup:{from:"departments",localField:"departmentId",foreignField:"_id",as:"department_information"}},{$unwind:"$department_information"},{$project:{employeeName:"$name",departmentName:"$department_information.name",_id:0}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$match:{salary:{$gte:50000},age:{$gt:25}}},{$group:{_id:"$address.city",avgSalary:{$avg:"$salary"},totalEmployees:{$sum:1},highestSalary:{$max:"$salary"},lowestSalary:{$min:"$salary"}}},{$sort:{"avgSalary":-1}},{$limit:2}])
